01:36:47,721 --> 01:36:48,856
So, let's bring it in.

750
01:36:48,906 --> 01:36:49,790
Let's embrace it.

751
01:36:49,840 --> 01:36:51,487
Let's figure it out together.

752
01:36:51,537 --> 01:37:01,285
